{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"How much two ETFs overlap"},"description":"How much of two ETFs is the same money: overlap by weight (the sum, over companies both hold, of the smaller of the two weights), how many companies they share, what share of each fund sits in names the other also holds, and the largest shared holdings. Full issuer files, matched on ISIN. Use it for \"VOO vs QQQ overlap\", \"is IVV the same as VOO\".","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"fund_a":{"description":"First fund ticker, e.g. \"VOO\".","examples":["VOO"],"maxLength":20,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9.^=\\-]{1,20}$","type":"string"},"fund_b":{"description":"Second fund ticker, e.g. \"QQQ\".","examples":["QQQ"],"maxLength":20,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9.^=\\-]{1,20}$","type":"string"},"limit":{"default":10,"description":"How many shared holdings to return (1\u201350, default 10).","maximum":50,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"}},"required":["fund_a","fund_b"],"type":"object"},"name":"etf_overlap","outputSchema":{"properties":{"a":{"type":"string"},"aInB":{"type":"number"},"asOf":{"properties":{"a":{"type":"string"},"b":{"type":"string"}},"required":["a","b"],"type":"object"},"b":{"type":"string"},"bInA":{"type":"number"},"onlyA":{"type":"integer"},"onlyB":{"type":"integer"},"overlap":{"type":"number"},"shared":{"items":{"properties":{"name":{"type":"string"},"ticker":{"type":["string","null"]},"weightA":{"type":"number"},"weightB":{"type":"number"}},"required":["ticker","name","weightA","weightB"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"sharedCount":{"type":"integer"},"url":{"type":"string"},"verdict":{"type":"string"}},"required":["a","b","overlap","verdict","sharedCount","aInB","bInA","onlyA","onlyB","asOf","url","shared"],"type":"object"},"title":"How much two ETFs overlap"}
